OL,3,GNEWSAThe jam or cream rivalry that has
OL,4,Anever scone away
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Cream or jam first is more divisive
OL,7,Fthan Brexit, I swear that's true."
OL,9,FJane Malyon, a cream tea expert and
OL,10,Fauthor of Scone or Scon(e) - the
OL,11,Fessential guide to British Afternoon
OL,12,FTea, remembered a time when she had
OL,13,Ffallen foul of the debate about how to
OL,14,Feat your scone.
OL,16,F"A newspaper printed an article once
OL,17,Fthat said a cream tea expert - me -
OL,18,Fsays 'it should be cream first'.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
