OL,3,GNEWSAThe jam or cream rivalry that has
OL,4,Anever scone away
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I didn't actually say that, what I
OL,7,Fsaid was what I tend to do is cream
OL,8,Ffirst, but the majority of people
OL,9,Fdon't.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
